<title>USA: Delta lowers fares from Atlanta.</title>
<headline>Delta lowers fares from Atlanta.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delta Air Lines said on Monday it introduced new low fares between Atlanta and 60 cities throughout the United States.</p>
<p>Many fares were $99 or less each way, based on round-trip purchase, the airline said.</p>
<p>The new fares required 14-day advance purchase and a Saturday night stay but were available for travel every day of the week, the company said.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
